<title>USA: Fortune Pete pulls secondary offering.</title>
<headline>Fortune Pete pulls secondary offering.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fortune Petroleum Corp said on Friday it has withdrawn its previously-announced public offering of common stock because it believes it would not get a fair value for its shares at current market prices.</p>
<p>The oil and gas exploration and production company said the offering was fully subscribed but that &quot;an appropriate price&quot; was a required component of the offering.</p>
<p>Shares closed at 1-5/8 on the American Stock Exchange on Thursday.</p>
